{"unit": "coppa-15usc6504#u000", "extractor": {"provider": "claude_cli", "model_role": "extractor", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "prompt_sha256": "ae23dcdbe8c047996abddf352e8b514454c65d95a123c3f4c4d0495b50444519", "prompt_version": "extract_v1"}, "status": "grounded", "item": "obligation", "text": "In any case in which the attorney general of a State has reason to believe that an interest of the residents of that State has been or is threatened or adversely affected by the engagement of any person in a practice that violates any regulation of the Commission prescribed under section 6502(b) of this title, the State, as parens patriae, may bring a civil action on behalf of the residents of the State in a district court of the United States of appropriate jurisdiction to-", "span": {"start": 439, "end": 918, "sha256": "7640aafad4fb39def36600d23a9ac3d269fbc4dc546dbd8b271c72b9443b4547", "parsed_sha256": "fded4547700ffefa2c2ca326a87f1ef51585825f9a2f35bec0036d98375e9b23"}, "matches_in_unit": 1, "section_path": "§6504. Actions by States > (1) Civil actions", "page": null, "force": "permission", "binds": "the State", "responsible_party_stated": true, "mechanism_stated": "in a district court of the United States of appropriate jurisdiction"}
{"unit": "coppa-15usc6504#u000", "extractor": {"provider": "claude_cli", "model_role": "extractor", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "prompt_sha256": "ae23dcdbe8c047996abddf352e8b514454c65d95a123c3f4c4d0495b50444519", "prompt_version": "extract_v1"}, "status": "grounded", "item": "obligation", "text": "Before filing an action under paragraph (1), the attorney general of the State involved shall provide to the Commission-", "span": {"start": 1200, "end": 1320, "sha256": "c56aabc975269ac85e7eaa214d47b63d18b5519320889c0236ea718d5fa479a2", "parsed_sha256": "fded4547700ffefa2c2ca326a87f1ef51585825f9a2f35bec0036d98375e9b23"}, "matches_in_unit": 1, "section_path": "§6504. Actions by States > (A) In general", "page": null, "force": "obligation", "binds": "the attorney general of the State involved", "responsible_party_stated": true, "mechanism_stated": "written notice of that action"}
{"unit": "coppa-15usc6504#u000", "extractor": {"provider": "claude_cli", "model_role": "extractor", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "prompt_sha256": "ae23dcdbe8c047996abddf352e8b514454c65d95a123c3f4c4d0495b50444519", "prompt_version": "extract_v1"}, "status": "grounded", "item": "obligation", "text": "In an action described in clause (i), the attorney general of a State shall provide notice and a copy of the complaint to the Commission at the same time as the attorney general files the action.", "span": {"start": 1750, "end": 1945, "sha256": "e86dc24ce4eb1ddb4286e54aee0e4cd1f42becb54c04a87919b4f801c49f6bf5", "parsed_sha256": "fded4547700ffefa2c2ca326a87f1ef51585825f9a2f35bec0036d98375e9b23"}, "matches_in_unit": 1, "section_path": "§6504. Actions by States > (ii) Notification", "page": null, "force": "obligation", "binds": "the attorney general of a State", "responsible_party_stated": true, "mechanism_stated": "at the same time as the attorney general files the action"}
{"unit": "coppa-15usc6504#u000", "extractor": {"provider": "claude_cli", "model_role": "extractor", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "prompt_sha256": "ae23dcdbe8c047996abddf352e8b514454c65d95a123c3f4c4d0495b50444519", "prompt_version": "extract_v1"}, "status": "grounded", "item": "obligation", "text": "On receiving notice under subsection (a)(2), the Commission shall have the right to intervene in the action that is the subject of the notice.", "span": {"start": 1991, "end": 2133, "sha256": "28aef961f519c4b604cec4796594531def928d01aea316a9847501be9d8a37e3", "parsed_sha256": "fded4547700ffefa2c2ca326a87f1ef51585825f9a2f35bec0036d98375e9b23"}, "matches_in_unit": 1, "section_path": "§6504. Actions by States > (1) In general", "page": null, "force": "permission", "binds": "the Commission", "responsible_party_stated": true, "mechanism_stated": "On receiving notice under subsection (a)(2)"}
{"unit": "coppa-15usc6504#u000", "extractor": {"provider": "claude_cli", "model_role": "extractor", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "prompt_sha256": "ae23dcdbe8c047996abddf352e8b514454c65d95a123c3f4c4d0495b50444519", "prompt_version": "extract_v1"}, "status": "grounded", "item": "obligation", "text": "If the Commission intervenes in an action under subsection (a), it shall have the right-", "span": {"start": 2168, "end": 2256, "sha256": "140e8a4305165620576c0aaac3403ed482f154ad71373a7522bee4cf5716cbb5", "parsed_sha256": "fded4547700ffefa2c2ca326a87f1ef51585825f9a2f35bec0036d98375e9b23"}, "matches_in_unit": 1, "section_path": "§6504. Actions by States > (2) Effect of intervention", "page": null, "force": "permission", "binds": "the Commission", "responsible_party_stated": true, "mechanism_stated": "to file a petition for appeal"}
{"unit": "coppa-15usc6504#u000", "extractor": {"provider": "claude_cli", "model_role": "extractor", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "prompt_sha256": "ae23dcdbe8c047996abddf352e8b514454c65d95a123c3f4c4d0495b50444519", "prompt_version": "extract_v1"}, "status": "grounded", "item": "obligation", "text": "Upon application to the court, a person whose self-regulatory guidelines have been approved by the Commission and are relied upon as a defense by any defendant to a proceeding under this section may file amicus curiae in that proceeding.", "span": {"start": 2394, "end": 2631, "sha256": "83b2b801611427e9aac855a56bcc4ba5cb1a9028b79beccbbf7c43343be38461", "parsed_sha256": "fded4547700ffefa2c2ca326a87f1ef51585825f9a2f35bec0036d98375e9b23"}, "matches_in_unit": 1, "section_path": "§6504. Actions by States > (3) Amicus curiae", "page": null, "force": "permission", "binds": "a person whose self-regulatory guidelines have been approved by the Commission", "responsible_party_stated": true, "mechanism_stated": "Upon application to the court"}
{"unit": "coppa-15usc6504#u000", "extractor": {"provider": "claude_cli", "model_role": "extractor", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "prompt_sha256": "ae23dcdbe8c047996abddf352e8b514454c65d95a123c3f4c4d0495b50444519", "prompt_version": "extract_v1"}, "status": "grounded", "item": "obligation", "text": "no State may, during the pendency of that action, institute an action under subsection (a) against any defendant named in the complaint in that action for violation of that regulation.", "span": {"start": 3249, "end": 3433, "sha256": "a2efbd338d244b80c535cd6fab9d1091b913a21472d76e3b19f91f822df1789a", "parsed_sha256": "fded4547700ffefa2c2ca326a87f1ef51585825f9a2f35bec0036d98375e9b23"}, "matches_in_unit": 1, "section_path": "§6504. Actions by States > (d) Actions by Commission", "page": null, "force": "prohibition", "binds": "State", "responsible_party_stated": true, "mechanism_stated": "during the pendency of that action"}
